================================================================================
                      4. LICENSE VALIDATION
================================================================================

4.1 PRO and ENTERPRISE features require periodic license validation (about
    once every 24 hours) via a secure HTTPS connection to the Licensor's
    license server.

4.2 A grace period of seventy-two (72) hours is provided for temporary
    internet connectivity interruptions. During this period, the Software
    will continue to operate with full licensed functionality.

4.3 After the grace period expires without successful validation, the Software
    will revert to FREE Mode until connectivity is restored. Energy control in
    FREE Mode continues to work.

4.4 License validation data transmitted includes only:
    - License Key
    - an installation identifier generated by the Software
    - Home Assistant and Software versions
    - Timestamp

    No energy usage data or home network information is transmitted for
    license validation.

================================================================================
                        5. LICENSE TIERS
================================================================================

  FREE (no fee)
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  • Autopilot and all strategies except the Weather strategy, including the
    Max Zysk battery arbitrage planner
  • Schedules, safety layers (import guard, SOC, voltage guard, export limit
    from the connection conditions), prosumer deposit, all sensors
  • Up to 4 PV strings, 1 turbine, notifications to 1 phone
  • Community support

  PRO (one-time fee, perpetual license, one Instance)
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  • Everything in FREE
  • AI features with the Licensee's own API key, Weather strategy, PV forecast
    calibration, SMS / e-mail and several phones, daily report, voltage
    report export, "Invoice vs Home Assistant", automatic updates with backup,
    up to 10 PV strings and several turbines
  • E-mail support

  ENTERPRISE (one-time fee or individual agreement, perpetual, up to 5 Instances)
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  • All PRO features
  • Priority support and terms agreed individually

  The exact feature split is described in the Software documentation and may
  change between versions; features of a purchased tier are not removed from
  that tier during the support period (Section 6).

================================================================================
                  6. ONE-TIME FEE, UPDATES AND SUPPORT PERIOD
================================================================================

6.1 PRO and ENTERPRISE licenses are granted for a one-time fee and are valid
    for an unlimited time (lifetime of the Software). No subscription or
    renewal fee applies.

6.2 Updates, including security fixes, are provided free of charge for a
    support period of at least five (5) years from the date of purchase.
    After the support period the license remains valid and the last
    installed version continues to work.

6.3 Licensor may change the price of new licenses at any time; this does not
    affect licenses already purchased.

