================================================================================
                      8. DATA & PRIVACY
================================================================================

8.1 The Software processes energy data locally within the Licensee's Home
    Assistant instance. Data leaves the instance only as described in the
    Software documentation: license validation (Section 4.4), basic
    installation information once per version (can be switched off),
    coordinates for the weather forecast provider, public price data from PSE,
    notifications the Licensee enables, and the installation showcase if the
    Licensee switches it on.

8.2 If the Licensee enables the AI Energy Advisor feature, system state data
    is transmitted directly from the Licensee's instance to the chosen AI
    provider (Google, Anthropic or OpenRouter) using the Licensee's own API key. Smarting
    HOME does not act as an intermediary for AI requests.

8.3 License validation data (Section 4.4) is processed in accordance with
    Polish data protection law and the EU General Data Protection Regulation
    (GDPR).

